@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Healthz (Readiness Check - Blue/Green)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### 2. Crear una orden ($50.00 = 5000 centavos)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalCents": 6000
}

### Capturar automáticamente el ID de la orden creada arriba
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### 3. Consultar el estado y saldo de la orden creada
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Listar las últimas 25 órdenes
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### 5. Aplicar primer pago parcial con tarjeta ($30.00 = 3000 centavos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pay-001

{
  "amountCents": 3000,
  "method": "CARD"
}

### 6. Reintento idempotente del mismo pago (Debe devolver 201 sin cobrar doble)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pay-001

{
  "amountCents": 3000,
  "method": "CARD"
}

### 7. Aplicar segundo pago parcial en efectivo ($20.00 = 2000 centavos -> Orden queda PAID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pay-002

{
  "amountCents": 2000,
  "method": "CASH"
}

### 8. Intentar sobrepago ($1.00 = 100 centavos -> Debe rechazar con 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pay-003

{
  "amountCents": 100,
  "method": "CARD"
}